# Walkthrough - Audit History Modernization

I have successfully renamed the "Compliance" page to "Audit History" throughout the application and modernized its design to match the premium dark theme.

## Changes

### 1. Renaming & Navigation
- **File Renamed**: [compliance.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/compliance.html) is now [audit-history.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/audit-history.html).
- **Global Navigation**: Updated the sidebar on **all pages** (Dashboard, Reports, Calculations, etc.) to:
    - Label: "Audit History" (was "Compliance")
    - Link: Points to [audit-history.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/audit-history.html)

### 2. UI Modernization ([audit-history.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/audit-history.html))
- **Glassmorphism**: Applied a `.glass-panel` container with backdrop blur and border styling for the main content.
- **Header**: Updated to "Audit History" with a subtitle explaining its purpose.
- **Spacing**: Optimized vertical spacing between the header and table by removing excess margins.
- **Table Design**: Enhanced readability with uppercase headers, subtle borders, and better spacing.
- **Buttons**: Styled the "Download Verification Report" button with a modern gradient and shadow effect.

### 3. Comprehensive Audit Logging & Data Seeding
- **System Cleanup**: Removed legacy files and user databases to ensure a clean slate.
- **Audit Logging**: Implemented a system-wide `activity_log` tracking logins, updates, and recalculations.
- **Frontend Integration**: Updated the "Audit History" table to display the full range of system activities, not just base year changes.
- **Data Seeding**: Created and executed [seed_script.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/seed_script.js)## Expanded Test Data (9-Year Horizon)
Seeded the platform with an extensive high-fidelity dataset:
- **1,188 Emission Records**: Full coverage of 5 facilities from **2016 to 2024**.
- **Diverse Categories**: Includes Scope 1 (Stationary, Mobile, Fugitive) and Scope 2 (Grid Electricity, District Heating).
- **Realistic Trends**: Applied a ~2.5% annual reduction trend and varied facility profiles.
- **Goals & Logs**: Seeded goals for all 9 years (plus future targets to 2030) and 75 audit trails.

## Audit Logging System
Implemented a centralized [logActivity](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/server.js#361-368) helper in the backend:
- **Comprehensive Tracking**: Every major action (Login, Goal Update, Facility Management, Emission Entry) is automatically logged.
- **Unified Viewing**: The [audit-history.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/audit-history.html) page now provides a single source of truth for all system changes.

